Notes view: 30

Three Methodologies
Design Thinking

“Explore the problem”

Design Thinking is a creative method that materializes an empathetic solution by focusing on the core needs of the customer they are building products for.
 Three complimentary working methods used together for maximum impact 
Lean UX

“Build the right things”

Lean UX is an experimental method of designing that tests all business model assumptions up front to remove unnecessary risks.
Agile Framework

“Build the things right”

Agile Thinking is a flexible working method that adapts to variables in an unpredictable environment. Agile methodology values response to change over following a set plan.

