Why Design System
Design System is need of the hour
Problems we can solve:
Design System closes the gap between the designers and UI engineers who work on multiple products. Designer and Developer communication is important to improve project workflow, as it helps save time and money.

It can also improve consistency across platforms, build more-intuitive products, and allow designers and engineers to focus on addressing bigger problems.
  
Design Quality
Deep focus on UI specifications robs time from designing highly valuable & engaging experiences.
Velocity
Considerable time is spent on recreating the basics for every feature and function.

Consistency
Lack of standards and consistency  has led to the accumulation of “Design Debt”.
Less User learning and Faster Adoption
It involves faster adoption and less user learning as reusable components makes it easy for the designers to incorporate while designing.
Heavy Reuse
Collection of reusable components, guided by clear standards, can be assembled together to build any number of applications.

People, processes, and shared assets that work together
