4 Ways of delivering value

A component-based toolkit accessible in one place allows for a more chunked-out Agile process, speeding up releases without compromising quality.
Design System Governance
Design System Governance is one of the important ingredients of design system. It is necessary to have a process/flow chart to control the governance of the Design System.
Increased Product Value
Decomposable components build upon each other, which creates a more consistent look, feel, and behavior to the product. As consistency increases, so too does user efficiency.
Increased Collaboration and Knowledge Sharing
Because the shared design system includes approved assets and conventions, designers and developers are more autonomous without closing off into silos.
Faster time to market with less money wasted
A component-based toolkit accessible in one place allows for a more chunked-out Agile process, speeding up releases without compromising quality.
